<title>USA: Hanaper says buys stake in Plymouth Rubber.</title>
<headline>Hanaper says buys stake in Plymouth Rubber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanaper Partners LP said in a statement Tuesday it has, along with members of the Propp family, acquired a 7.8 percent stake in the class A voting shares of Plymouth Rubber Co Inc.</p>
<p>Hanaper said its group had also purchased a position in the class B nonvoting shares.</p>
<p>Hanaper Partners is a private hedge fund that invests primarily in small capitalization companies.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately able to provide information on how much money it paid for the stake.</p>
</text>
